# Town Module Table Stream Handoff

## Current objective

Implement a new Cloudflare Agent Dungeon prototype that feels like a real, fast-moving OSE table playing through the frozen **Fenwater Drainage** town module.

The old `/prototype/town-module` monitor taught the right lessons but feels like server machinery. The next slice should be a new always-running table stream, not more patches on the old tavern-town monitor.

Primary design note: [[projects/town-module-table-stream]].

